    "description": "Investors, house hackers, and visionaries, this is your chance to reimagine a classic 1906 legal triplex that lives like a duplex in the heart of SOMA. Each 3BD/2BA unit features tall ceilings, hardwood floors, a fireplace in the living room, in-unit washer/dryer, and abundant natural light. Efficient layouts and charming period details like picture rails and wainscoting throughout. Stairs from each level lead directly to a flat, fenced yard, perfect for summer barbecues or weekend projects. The full-footprint garage fits up to four cars and includes a full bathroom, opening the door to future expansion, an ADU, or a creative workspace. The top-floor unit is vacant and ready for immediate renovation, while the middle unit is tenant-occupied at market rent. Located just blocks from Mission Bay, Moscone Center, Oracle Park, and Downtown, with quick access to restaurants, nightlife, events, and freeways. Projected 8.9% cap rate post-renovation and estimated $1.4M ARV. An exceptional opportunity to build value in one of San Francisco's most dynamic neighborhoods."
  },
